    \u2013 SILAB\r\nA'SLAG \u2013 SASLAG\r\nBURAK \u2013 LAHAR\r\nE\u2019MUT \u2013
    AMUT\r\nGABUN \u2013 LABWAD\r\nSACUNA \u2013 CALAMIDAD\r\nTAGULING \u2013 CANAL\r\nU'YAT
